      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1190259730,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The problem is that the label field is coming into the Item constructor with a quote at the end but not the beginning.\n\ne.g.\nRoute version\"\n\nNI version\"\n\nWe could set the regex to include the double quotes or not.  I'd probably prefer to match them without.  For that I deleted a couple of * chars from the regex at line 627.  The 2nd group is the label - it works better if I remove the 2 * that followed \\\".  It may be easier if I push that as a separate change..",
          "author": {
            "id": 6810036,
            "username": "martin.r.mathieson",
